"<span>F</span>\\(d_\\mathrm{in}\\) (m)",
"<span>G</span>Load \\(F_\\mathrm{out}\\) (N)",
"<span>H</span>\\(d_\\mathrm{out}\\) (m)",
"<span>I</span>IMA = \\(d_\\mathrm{in}/d_\\mathrm{out}\\)",
"<span>J</span>AMA = \\(F_\\mathrm{out}/F_\\mathrm{in}\\)",
